 electronic devices.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="298004">high-definition multimedia interface</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="631606">High-Definition Multimedia Interface</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11744_38453_630327"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person, inside or outside your organization, for whom you have created an entry where you can save several types of information, such as street and email addresses, telephone and fax numbers, and Web page URLs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="38453">contact</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="630327">kontakt</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="11748_136786_630956"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A display setting that holds up to 256 specific color entries. Any color palette attached to a picture is by definition an 8-bit palette.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="136786">8-bit color</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="630956">8-bitars farge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpee