eate reports that draw content from a variety of data sources, publish reports in various formats, and centrally manage security and subscriptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608214">Microsoft SQL Server Reporting Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2770576">SSRS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16183_169566_2770576"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The server-based report generation environment for enterprise, Web-enabled reporting functionality that allows users to create reports that draw content from a variety of data sources, publish reports in various formats, and centrally manage security and subscriptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169566">SQL Server Reporting Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2770576">SSRS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16183_169567_2770576"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The server-based report generation environment for enterprise, Web-enabled reporting functionality that allows users to create reports that draw content from a variety of data sources, publish reports in various formats, and centrally manage security and subscriptions.<