icular purpose, such as "instant message area."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="502935">area</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1207118">felt</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1700_122674_1453006"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of viewing and updating the actual progress of tasks so that you can see progress across time, evaluate slippage of tasks, compare scheduled or baseline data to actual data, and check the completion percentage of tasks and your project.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="122674">tracking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1453006">sporing</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17006_637852_2543329"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of permissions that can be granted to users or SharePoint groups on an entity such as a site, library, list, folder, item, or document.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="637852">site group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2543329">tilgangsnivå</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote