 initiates an email response addressed to all of the recipients on the To or Cc lines of the original message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767631">Reply to All</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1207451">Svar alle</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21265_767632_1207451"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that initiates an email response addressed to all of the recipients on the To or Cc lines of the original message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="767632">Reply All</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1207451">Svar alle</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2127_503149_1981064"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A color-coded icon that indicates a user's presence.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="503149">presence icon</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1981064">nærværsikon</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote 