e module label leads to a webpage that lists all items. The items that are available in preview are redundantly available in the list of all items, which may be paginated.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1032209">View all</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1522726">Vis alt</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22243_1032209_2525675"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The link that appears above an incomplete content set and leads to the full list of items. For example, when a content module displays items 1–6, a "View all" link in line with the module label leads to a webpage that lists all items. The items that are available in preview are redundantly available in the list of all items, which may be paginated.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1032209">View all</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2525675">Siste</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22244_1034315_2525567"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A favorite saved as a .url file in someone's "Shared favorites" folder.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1034315">shared favorite</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote ty