c, pictures and videos available on your home network. The feature must be activated on at least two computers in order to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1050253">remote media connection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1207530">ekstern medietilkopling</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2260_2421477_2423526"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft program that allows users to select and print a variety of customizable calendar templates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2421477">Calendar Printing Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2423526">Calendar Printing Assistant</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2260_331777_2423526"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft program that allows users to select and print a variety of customizable calendar templates.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="331777">Calendar Printing Assistant for Microsoft® Office Outlook® 2007</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2423526">Calendar Printing Assistant</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22604_1050707_1981334"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A telephone that sits on a desk and is to be used with Lync Server and Office Communications Server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1050707">desk phone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1981334">bordtelefon</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22613_1050742_2545789"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To gain access to all device functionality by entering the correct password or other form of authentication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1050742">unlock</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2545789">låse opp</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22615_1050744_1981335"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A numeric keypad that is part of a device, is displayed on a device, or is in a computer program that you use to enter information in the context of a phone call.</descri