or the computer that they plan to sync.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1346464">Personalize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2525583">Tilpass</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="26687_1346465_2525584"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The group label for the links that provide one-click access to a subset of email messages based on specific criteria, such as flagged, containing photos, and from social networking services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1346465">Quick views</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2525584">Hurtigvisingar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2669_153111_631091"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The number of bits transmitted every second, used as a measure of the speed at which a device, such as a modem, can transfer data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="153111">bits per second</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="631091">bitar per sekund</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun