alNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31706_1612781_1769382"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The API for networking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1612781">Networking API</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1769382">Nettverks-API</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31707_1673088_1676897"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The beta release of the Windows 8 operating system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1673088">Windows 8 Consumer Preview</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1676897">Windows 8 Consumer Preview</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31720_1616560_2567664"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Zooming behavior that is specified by the developer. Zooming in on a UI or a collection of things and providing greater, meaningful context. You might zoom in on a collection of photos and suddenly titles or dates appear. The photos may go from file names to thumbnails or from small thumbnails to large ones, or from thumbnails to full photo files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1616560">semantic zoom</term><termNote typ