 or requested action in an email message and enables the user to take action on it from within the message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623953">Action Items</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1762514">Gjeremål</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31784_1623954_1762538"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that alerts the user before an email message is sent if it detects that an attachment may have been omitted from the message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623954">Attachment Reminder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1762538">Påminning om vedlegg</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="31785_1623955_1762613"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list or library that is shared between site collections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1623955">catalog</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="1762613">katalog</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNo