 these components persistent across applications, so that changes made to components in part of Microsoft 365 will carry through to the others, thus enabling a unified experience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2874478">Microsoft 365 Groups</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2875810">Microsoft 365 Grupper</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="36806_2072312_2076133"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The database that stores search feature settings which include but are not limited to query rules and the search schema.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2072312">search settings database</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2076133">database for søkjeinnstillingar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="36807_2072313_2076018"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that enables the user to record on-screen activity, and embeds the video automatically in PowerPoint.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2072313">Screen Recording</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2076018">