 for the addition of Headers, Text and Media from the Web or local device, and Layout options at the indicated location.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139125">Add content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2525610">Legg til innhald</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37485_2139126_2228222"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway option button under “Add Content” that allows users to select an office document and import it into Sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139126">Import Document</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2228222">Importer dokument</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="37486_2139127_2525611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The menu option in Sway under the “Add Content” button that analyzes the user’s Sway to suggest useful content that can be browsed or added as desired.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2139127">Suggested Content</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2525611">Foreslått innhald</term><termNote ty