agement, DirectAccess, and BranchCache.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227165">Windows 10 Education</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230257">Windows 10 Education</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38428_2227166_2230262"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of Windows 10 that is available only through volume licensing, is designed for businesses, and includes all of the features of Windows 10 Pro, plus some other features like virtualization, management, DirectAccess, and BranchCache.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227166">Windows 10 Enterprise</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230262">Windows 10 Enterprise</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38429_2227167_2230274"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The edition of Windows 10 designed for HoloLens.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2227167">Windows 10 Holographic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2230274">Windows 10 Holographic</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote>