 line-of-business apps available to customers through an online market.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331304">line-of-business publisher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332576">bransjeutgivar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40116_2331305_2332576"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A person or business that makes line-of-business apps available to customers through an online market.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331305">LOB publisher</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332576">bransjeutgivar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40118_2331575_2332611"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that is licensed by a company in bulk for use by end users.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331575">volume application</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332611">volumprogram</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4012_335489_2543365"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tab, located on the Action menu in the Filter Report group, that enables the user to further refine the records for a report.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="335489">Advanced Filter tab</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2543365">Avansert filter-fana</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40121_2331937_2335126"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An automatically generated filter list in Wunderlist (e.g. Today, Week, Assigned to me, Starred, All, and Completed Smart List) that shows all tasks from across all your task lists that meet the specific criteria.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331937">smart list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2335126">smartliste</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40122_2331938_2335129"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Mac OS X specific part of the app that allows Wunderlist to receive push notifications on the Mac.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331938">Wunderlist Helper</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2335129">Wunderlist-hjelpar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40123_2331939_2335125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Wunderlist feature that allows users to enter due dates for a task as text (e.g. next Sunday), automatically recognize the date, and set a due date and reminder for the task.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2331939">Smart Due Dates</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2335125">Smarte forfallsdatoar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40124_2332081_2335118"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that gives users information regarding the safety of a message via a colored bar inserted into the message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2332081">Safety Tips</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2335118">Tyggleikstips</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><te