 of their team members and add them to messages or chats.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375542">Add people</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686515">Legg til personar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41985_2375544_2686591"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub view that allows users to view all the details of their time off, such as type of time off, time and date, and the reason for the time off.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375544">Time off details</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686591">Fråværsdetaljar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41986_2375545_2686588"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub feature that allows users to view all the different types of time off they have scheduled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375545">Time off</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686588">Fråvær</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termN