erNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686520">DAGNOTAT</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41991_2375555_2686586"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub feature that allows users to find and view the StaffHub profile of their coworkers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375555">Team members</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686586">Teammedlemmar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="41992_2375557_2686518"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The StaffHub feature that allows users to switch to another team.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2375557">Change team</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2686518">Byt team</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42013_2376461_2379564"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The grouping of similar apps together on the taskbar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2376461">glomming</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2379564">gruppering</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Feminine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42014_2376761_2567710"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The ribbon tab that gives users a set of options for editing graphics in their PowerPoint slides, Word documents, and Excel documents.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2376761">Graphics Tools</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2567710">Grafikkverktøy</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Masculine</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="42015_2376763_2567711"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that allows users to replace a graphic with a different one.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2376763">Change Graphic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2567711">Endre grafikk</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">Neuter</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNo