ives it an effect of muted late evening light.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549945">Twilight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2552117">Skumring</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45150_2549970_2552124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the red and orange tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549970">Energy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2552124">Energi</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45151_2549985_2552125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the blue tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549985">Iceberg</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2552125">Isfjell</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singula