eviews of the latest features and content on Xbox. Users can earn XP by completing surveys, polls, and quests, and also by providing developers and engineers with feedback to make improvements before releasing new features and products.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2595012">Xbox Insider Hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2921714">Xbox Insider Hub</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46083_2596064_2921710"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system app that enables PC games to connect to Xbox Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2596064">Xbox Identity Provider</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2921710">Xbox Identity Provider</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46085_2596471_2599524"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature within Word that helps users draft a better resume with example content and skill suggestions from LinkedIn, tailored for a role.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2596471">Resume Assistant</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><te