s to a feature release of a product, such that a customer needs to upgrade to a new feature release to continue receiving support from Microsoft.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2878237">EOL</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2923602">sluttdato for tenesta</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46381_3128246_3128721"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature for Windows commercial customers that helps mitigate security threats by restricting the applications that users are allowed to run and the code that runs in the System Core (kernel).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128246">App Control for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128721">Appkontroll for verksemder</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46381_3128246_3128722"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature for Windows commercial customers that helps mitigate security threats by restricting the applications that users are allowed to run and the code that runs in the System Core (kernel).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3128246">App Control for Business</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="gram