65 and Enterprise Mobility + Security) targeted for Firstline Workers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844882">Microsoft 365 F1</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849486">Microsoft 365 F1</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50346_2844883_2849307"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The end-to-end security solution designed to provide a view of an organization's overall threat landscape so that administrators can easily spot new threats and attacks.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844883">Microsoft Defender XDR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849307">Microsoft Defender XDR</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50346_2844883_3144520"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The end-to-end security solution designed to provide a view of an organization's overall threat landscape so that administrators can easily spot new threats and attacks.​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2844883">Microsoft Defender XDR</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3144520">Defe