ty content providers, and an organization’s own custom content—to help teams and individuals to make learning a natural part of their day.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929085">Learning</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929489">Viva Learning</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51981_2926576_2928681"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows users to convert the image to text with screenshare during a Microsoft Teams meeting (the ability for meeting attendees to digitize and interact with text and URLs on the Teams meeting stage).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926576">screen share scanner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928681">skjermdelingsskannar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51982_2926577_2928674"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Teams service that simplifies the communications services acquisition and adoption process for business customers, providing the option to provision/deprovision phone numbers and (eventually) acquire/obtain capabilities from certified Carriers, all through the Teams Admin Center.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926577">Operator Connect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928674">Operatørtilkopling</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51983_2926579_2928667"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab in Microsoft Teams that allows the user to create, manage, and share approval requests such as stakeholder authorizations, customer signatures, or manager acknowledgements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926579">Approvals</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928667">Godkjenningar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51984_2926583_2928670"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Teams, the way to present in which only the shared content itself is shown.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926583">Content only</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928670">Berre innhald</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51985_2926584_2928683"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Teams, option in Presenter Mode in which the shared content is shown as a background to the video of the presenter.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926584">Standout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928683">Framheva</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51986_2926585_2928673"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The preview version of the Learning app in Microsoft Teams.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926585">Learning (Preview)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928673">Læring (prøveversjon)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="51987_2926606_2928671"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The state of work in which one is able to focus completely on a task without distraction.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2926606">deep work</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928671">konsentrert arbeid</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52001_2928689_2929284"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The security feature that helps users identify a sign-in option to verify a supplemental signal in the background while they provide their credentials.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928689">additional factor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929284">tilleggsfaktor</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52002_2928699_2929285"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft Edge feature that helps users solve math problems and shows them the step-by-step solution.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928699">Math Solver</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929285">Matteløysar</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52003_2928705_2929288"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The browsing mode within Microsoft Edge that is dedicated for kids, containing kid-friendly and age-appropriate content with safety guardrails.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928705">Kids Mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929288">Barnemodus</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52004_2928726_2929287"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature package of web-dependent Windows experiences that is serviced/deployed through the Microsoft Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2928726">Windows Web Experience Pack</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929287">Grensesnittpakke for Windows Web</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52005_2929086_2929487"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Bookings user with an admin role.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929086">Bookings admin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929487">Bookings-administrator</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52006_2929515_2929763"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Server file sharing feature that allows users to set caps on the portion of network capacity taken up by traffic using the SMB protocol.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929515">SMB bandwidth limit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929763">SMB-bandbreiddgrense</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52008_2929517_2929764"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows feature that uses hardware virtualization to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system which can be used to host security solutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929517">virtualization-based security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929764">virtualiseringsbasert tryggleik</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52008_2929517_2929765"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows feature that uses hardware virtualization to create and isolate a secure region of memory from the normal operating system which can be used to host security solutions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2929517">virtualization-based security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNo