plications, bringing human connection back into hybrid work to enable teams to think, plan, and create together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3022592">Microsoft Loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3017815">Loop</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53056_3022592_3023316"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The universal interactive canvas application that moves freely across applications, bringing human connection back into hybrid work to enable teams to think, plan, and create together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3022592">Microsoft Loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3023316">Microsoft Loop</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53057_3017117_3017820"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Loop element that lets the user see, group, organize, and stay up-to-date with all the Loop pages, files, and collateral for their team project in a single space.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3017117">Loop workspace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3017820