nce app in Microsoft Teams that provides seamless scheduling, analytics, and premium experiences for business-to-customer meetings, bringing together current virtual appointment experiences into one single entry point.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3153774">Virtual Appts</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3053982">Virtuelle avtaler</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53226_3031837_3033353"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The legacy version of School Data Sync.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031837">School Data Sync (classic)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033353">School Data Sync (klassisk)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53227_3031838_3033352"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The device marketplace in the Microsoft Teams Admin Center that drives discovery and adoption of Teams devices from Teams Admin Center marketplace.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3031838">Microsoft Teams device store</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033352">Microsoft Teams einingsbutikk</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53235_3033414_3033593"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The simulator for ARDK head-mounted displays that runs on Windows PCs and requires a physical + connected Samsung phone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033414">ARDK Simulator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033593">ARDK simulator</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53236_3033415_3033592"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application for ARDK users that provides the software platform for ARDK features like hand tracking and eye tracking.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033415">ARDK Platform</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="nn-NO"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033592">ARDK plattform</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">NOR</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53237_3033416_3033591"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application for ARDK users that hosts the system UI, including the applicat